  "description": "FileFormat.Cells is a smart open-source .NET SDK for automating Excel Spreadsheet creation, manipulation, and management. Built on top of OpenXML, this extensible C# library enables easy workbook creation, worksheet modification, and advanced features like Protect worksheet, Freeze Panes, Auto-Fit Columns. Ideal for developers looking to streamline Excel file automation in .NET applications.",
